      "content": "\"let go of everything\"... what does that even mean? you make it sound so simple. like there's just a switch i can flip to stop feeling so hollow. it's just that every day i wake up and realize i'm still here, still just... nothing. i dont have a job, i dont have a purpose, i dont even recognize the person in the mirror. it just feels like i'm clinging to a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
